@host = http://localhost:5219

### health
GET {{host}}/healthz

### --- M1: register a video for analysis
POST {{host}}/videos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "videoId": "demo-1", "videoUri": "/tmp/demo-1.mp4", "analyzer": "mock" }

### job status / map
GET {{host}}/videos/demo-1
GET {{host}}/videos/demo-1/map

### --- M2: platforms + campaigns (seeded from seed/adserving.sample.json)
GET {{host}}/platforms
GET {{host}}/campaigns

### ad decision for the player snippet (200 = ad, 204 = no ad + X-Advideo-NoAd-Reason)
GET {{host}}/ads/decision?platform=demo-portal&videoId=demo-1&t=2.5&geo=SK&viewer=anon-123

### why this ad / why not (all candidates with scores and rejection reasons)
GET {{host}}/ads/explain?platform=demo-portal&videoId=demo-1&t=2.5

### pause / resume a campaign
POST {{host}}/campaigns/tesla-model-y/pause
POST {{host}}/campaigns/tesla-model-y/resume

### report delivery events for a decision (use decisionId from /ads/decision)
POST {{host}}/ads/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "decisionId": "dcs_...", "type": "impression", "t": 2.5 }

### campaign stats
GET {{host}}/campaigns/tesla-model-y/stats
